1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,420
What happened with Sheikh Ibn Baz when an afflicted woman came to him?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,290
Sheikh ‘Abd al-‘Aziz ibn Baz (may Allah have mercy on him) mentioned

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:09,010
that a woman was afflicted by jinn possession,

4
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:11,710
and that the jinn declared his Islam in front of him.

5
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,720
When some people denied this,

6
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:17,490
the Sheikh wrote an article showing that a jinn’s entering a human

7
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,700
is established by the Qur’an, the Sunnah and the consensus of Ahl al-Sunnah,

8
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,270
and that denying it is a mistake.

9
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,870
But be careful:

10
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:29,270
the scholars themselves say that many of those who claim to speak with jinn are liars.

11
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,550
So do not believe everyone who claims that,

12
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:33,170
and do not attribute every illness to jinn.

13
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,490
The truth in this matter is the middle way:

14
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,750
no denial of possession that is established by the text, and no exaggeration of it,

15
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:41,300
and combining sharʿī ruqyah with the doctor.

16
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:44,320
Share this clip with someone you love, and follow the channel.

